{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5HcpCVNq61yNRzSbaq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I am locked.\n\nA heavy, iron-bound door stands before you. The wood is ancient oak, dark and scarred by centuries. A single keyhole glows faintly — waiting.\n\nNo handle turns. No force will move me.\n\n**Present the key.**\n\n🔒"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":65,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}